# Rust
proxy/target/

# Node
node_modules/
sdk/dist/
# cli/dist/ is intentionally TRACKED (round 26 F2). The CLI's bin
# points at dist/index.js and `files: [dist]` ships it on npm publish,
# so the published artifact must match the source. The CI parity step
# (cli/dist parity) re-runs `npm run build` and fails when the tracked
# dist drifts from a fresh build of src.

